  "title": "Qt: Fix a crash in Endpoints/Conversations if recentList is NULL",
  "description": "In strange situations the recent list might be NULL. There also\nmight be a situation where the protocol at the beginning of the\nrecent list doesn't exist by that short name anymore, if the user\nhas a recent file from a different version of Wireshark.\n\nAlso, don't both removing a tab if we'll automatically add it back\nin. Perhaps this logic should be different not to automatically\nadd back in the tab, but at least it's better not to reset the\nmodel only to leave it back as it was.\n\nFix #19869",
